WEBVTT

00:09.657 --> 00:10.851
Hold it!

00:11.559 --> 00:12.787
He's making a run for the forest!

00:12.927 --> 00:13.894
Don't lose him!

00:22.804 --> 00:23.566
See him?

00:23.938 --> 00:27.032
No, but I'm sure he
ran into this area.

00:27.575 --> 00:28.234
Damn!

00:28.309 --> 00:29.298
Look harder!

00:48.730 --> 00:53.224
There's no way I can reach
that distant sky.

01:07.982 --> 01:12.214
I met you in the dark forests
of the Underglobe...

01:12.287 --> 01:14.619
...created by the Dragons.

01:23.698 --> 01:24.687
Where am I?

01:41.783 --> 01:43.182
Did I make it out alive?

01:44.585 --> 01:45.449
Oh...

01:47.121 --> 01:48.145
Thank goodness.

01:49.724 --> 01:51.214
You're able to move now.

01:54.028 --> 01:55.325
It was strange.

02:00.268 --> 02:04.432
She nursed me, a total stranger,
back to health...

02:04.505 --> 02:06.097
...and provided me with food.

02:11.479 --> 02:12.503
What do you think?

02:13.681 --> 02:15.444
It's still a bud.

02:15.950 --> 02:18.009
Although it is growing.

02:18.386 --> 02:20.820
I guess there's
not enough light here.

02:21.222 --> 02:25.522
The flowers blooming,
or your injuries healing...

02:25.593 --> 02:27.220
Let's see which happens first.

02:27.829 --> 02:29.626
I just found it strange...

02:29.697 --> 02:33.793
...that a girl like that would be
so kind to a complete stranger.

02:40.108 --> 02:41.598
- Hey! Hurry up!
- I'm coming!

03:26.587 --> 03:27.315
Sui!

03:27.655 --> 03:28.485
Sui!

03:58.886 --> 03:59.875
Sui...

04:00.655 --> 04:01.986
If only I had a power...

04:04.659 --> 04:09.028
...I would not have lost
such a precious person.

04:11.966 --> 04:12.625
Hexa...

04:13.734 --> 04:14.564
Hexa...

04:15.603 --> 04:19.437
Have you really
forgotten everything?

04:20.908 --> 04:22.239
Hexa!

04:39.327 --> 04:43.024
Yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

04:43.097 --> 04:46.760
kokoro umore naku nari sou

04:46.834 --> 04:50.133
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

04:50.204 --> 04:52.764
taisetsu na koto wa

04:52.840 --> 04:55.104
oshiete yo

04:55.176 --> 04:56.734
ne

04:56.978 --> 05:01.711
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

05:01.782 --> 05:06.810
Machigai dato omowa sete

05:07.355 --> 05:11.121
akireru hodoni aishiteta

05:11.192 --> 05:14.719
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

05:14.795 --> 05:18.128
osoreru koto nante nani

05:18.199 --> 05:21.896
hitotsu naito shinji teta

05:21.969 --> 05:25.461
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

05:25.540 --> 05:29.203
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

05:29.277 --> 05:32.576
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

05:32.647 --> 05:36.276
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

05:36.350 --> 05:42.118
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

05:55.703 --> 05:59.240
The Unforgettable Tragedy
The Unforgettable Tragedy.

05:59.240 --> 06:02.767
The Unforgettable Tragedy

06:13.788 --> 06:15.119
Master Sui!

06:18.826 --> 06:21.056
You're up against me.

06:21.495 --> 06:23.520
Don't think that you've beaten me...

06:23.598 --> 06:26.192
...just because you saw through
my illusion.

06:26.634 --> 06:28.431
Well, I'll leave you to this.

06:30.771 --> 06:31.465
He disappeared!

06:40.514 --> 06:41.879
Don't you understand yet?

06:46.854 --> 06:49.152
You shouldn't be
looking elsewhere!

06:59.033 --> 07:02.833
No matter what kind of power
he might have used...

07:03.537 --> 07:04.731
...there's no way...

07:04.805 --> 07:08.639
...anyone can completely erase
memories and emotions.

07:10.177 --> 07:12.611
I'm sure you will be
able to remember!

07:13.581 --> 07:15.708
We have to take back
what was taken from us!

07:16.717 --> 07:17.376
Hexa!

07:23.324 --> 07:27.590
Well, I wonder where my
trophy collection is.

07:29.397 --> 07:30.295
How strange.

07:30.831 --> 07:34.198
I'm sure this is
where Heat was defeated.

07:40.474 --> 07:41.406
Bingo!

07:43.511 --> 07:44.603
Then, how about...!

07:54.555 --> 07:55.886
M-Miss Rorec...!

07:59.193 --> 08:02.526
I was looking forward to
making you my slave.

08:03.230 --> 08:07.929
But it looks like I'm going to
have to punish you first.

08:08.536 --> 08:09.468
Just try it!

08:10.438 --> 08:13.271
How dare the little punk
speak to Miss Rorec like that!

08:30.791 --> 08:31.689
Rumina...

08:49.343 --> 08:51.038
You are a tricky one.

08:53.047 --> 08:55.311
But there's nothing
you can do now.

08:56.083 --> 08:57.277
Just give up!

09:05.993 --> 09:07.961
You're not in the clear yet.

09:11.699 --> 09:12.495
Damn!

09:12.800 --> 09:15.496
I can't be held up
in a place like this!

09:15.936 --> 09:19.463
Ruri's waiting on
the other side of that bridge!

09:24.011 --> 09:26.206
Aww, come on!

09:27.915 --> 09:29.473
It won't open at all!

09:30.117 --> 09:33.484
What are Rumina and
Ginnosuke doing, anyway?!

09:43.464 --> 09:46.365
What's going on up there?

09:47.368 --> 09:48.335
All right!

09:54.875 --> 09:55.637
Okay!

10:23.537 --> 10:25.232
Now, give up.

10:26.140 --> 10:28.734
There's nowhere you can run to.

11:14.788 --> 11:16.085
Have you really...

11:16.891 --> 11:19.018
Have you really forgotten me?

11:19.360 --> 11:20.486
Have you?

11:29.603 --> 11:30.763
Hexa...

11:49.690 --> 11:52.682
Hexa, do you remember this?

11:54.128 --> 11:56.187
This is from those old days.

11:56.664 --> 11:59.599
You liked the sound
of this harmonica.

12:17.685 --> 12:19.414
Hexa...

12:41.108 --> 12:44.100
You could catch cold
dressed like that out here.

12:47.815 --> 12:48.577
Right.

12:50.417 --> 12:52.510
Don't cry! Please don't cry!

12:52.920 --> 12:56.879
I'll take you to as many
flower gardens as you want!

12:57.491 --> 12:58.423
Rumina...

13:04.164 --> 13:05.153
Rumina...

13:24.151 --> 13:25.618
I'll never forget.

13:27.721 --> 13:32.522
That smile, that voice,
those eyes...

13:33.794 --> 13:36.627
If the girl is waiting
on the other side of the bridge...

13:36.697 --> 13:41.361
...there is only one thing the hero
fighting for justice must do!

13:44.104 --> 13:45.036
Is that it?!

13:45.105 --> 13:46.367
I'm coming, Ruri!

13:48.275 --> 13:49.640
I'm not letting you by.

13:54.314 --> 13:57.750
Sorry, but I'm the hero
who must rescue the girl!

13:57.818 --> 14:02.312
I'll blow away any of you goons
who tries to interfere with me!

14:02.523 --> 14:04.514
Wind Storm!

14:07.661 --> 14:08.355
I got him!

14:13.534 --> 14:15.297
H-He disappeared!

14:15.936 --> 14:17.198
Wh-Where did he go?!

14:22.543 --> 14:23.669
An illusion!

14:30.651 --> 14:33.142
Not only are you unable
to counter me...

14:33.220 --> 14:36.587
...you can't even see me
properly anymore.

14:42.596 --> 14:44.120
You lose.

14:59.546 --> 15:00.513
Come on!

15:00.581 --> 15:04.608
Why is it that only at times like
these the elevator doesn't work?

15:05.119 --> 15:06.609
Give me a break!

15:07.054 --> 15:07.986
Okay...

15:42.389 --> 15:43.754
Miss Rorec!

15:44.458 --> 15:47.359
Jilherts, I have a favor to ask you.

15:47.561 --> 15:49.654
Rather, this is an order.

15:57.671 --> 15:58.569
What's this?

15:58.806 --> 16:01.434
Make sure he doesn't know
you have it.

16:01.975 --> 16:02.600
Right...

16:10.818 --> 16:12.581
Do you understand now?

16:13.120 --> 16:16.487
Your attacks don't work on me
whatsoever.

16:19.793 --> 16:24.958
I heard about a guy who manipulates
waves of compressed air.

16:25.499 --> 16:27.023
To think it was you.

16:27.434 --> 16:30.597
That's right. It's my wall of air,
the "Airwave Ball"!

16:40.547 --> 16:41.741
Give it up.

16:42.216 --> 16:45.208
No matter how quickly you're able
to move in order to avoid me...

16:45.285 --> 16:47.913
...my ears can pinpoint your
exact position...

16:47.988 --> 16:51.287
...and I can counter your
move every time.

16:52.392 --> 16:54.952
It's clear who's going to win.

16:55.028 --> 16:56.518
I wonder about that.

17:02.502 --> 17:03.628
Now you're throwing a tantrum.

17:06.006 --> 17:07.303
How disappointing.

17:07.975 --> 17:10.569
How many times are you
going to repeat the same thing?

17:12.613 --> 17:13.739
Forget it...

17:24.691 --> 17:25.919
The water main?!

17:28.195 --> 17:29.719
I can't use...

17:30.297 --> 17:32.663
You can't use your famous ears.

17:45.913 --> 17:48.177
Maybe it's time you give up?

17:54.254 --> 17:56.222
Miss Rorec!

17:56.290 --> 17:57.780
You're so cool!

17:58.825 --> 18:00.486
Give up?

18:00.694 --> 18:03.026
That's what you ought to do?

18:03.830 --> 18:04.797
What?!

18:04.865 --> 18:07.993
What are you talking about?!
You're all messed up!

18:08.368 --> 18:11.735
How did you think
you could beat Chelsea?!

18:11.805 --> 18:15.366
Maybe you should apologize,
go home, then go to bed.

18:16.310 --> 18:18.870
Why don't you say something?

18:19.012 --> 18:19.740
Huh?! Say something! Huh?!

18:35.595 --> 18:36.619
It's okay.

18:37.230 --> 18:38.595
Just try shooting me.

18:40.701 --> 18:45.866
There's no way you would be able
to use that gun properly in a fight.

18:48.041 --> 18:49.633
As soon as you miss...

18:49.710 --> 18:52.474
...I'll let loose my
poisonous hands on you.

18:53.580 --> 18:54.205
Damn!

18:56.316 --> 18:58.910
If only I had my glasses.

19:02.055 --> 19:04.023
If you're not going to fire...

19:04.091 --> 19:06.082
...I guess I'll just have to
come to you!

19:10.864 --> 19:12.695
Even if I'm not...

19:12.766 --> 19:18.261
...much help to my friends
when we're fighting...

19:21.008 --> 19:24.171
...I will at least make sure
I'm not holding them back.

19:25.112 --> 19:27.046
I will...

19:31.151 --> 19:32.641
I will fight!

19:36.556 --> 19:37.386
What?!

19:38.625 --> 19:39.649
Ice?!

19:52.072 --> 19:52.970
I did it!

20:43.924 --> 20:48.759
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:48.829 --> 20:54.825
migakareru machi nami wo

20:54.901 --> 21:07.211
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.048 --> 21:18.925
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:18.992 --> 21:30.563
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.271 --> 21:40.179
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.247 --> 21:43.910
kikou to shita

21:43.984 --> 21:52.187
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.259 --> 22:01.065
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.043 --> 22:11.943
Preview

22:12.779 --> 22:14.076
Annoying one!

22:14.147 --> 22:16.843
A power user who controls
people with sound.

22:16.917 --> 22:18.578
I'd better stop that flute.

22:18.652 --> 22:21.314
I'm sure there's a weakness
somewhere.

22:21.888 --> 22:25.255
I know, this just might
block his power.

22:25.592 --> 22:27.526
All right!
We'll settle this once and for all!

22:27.761 --> 22:29.888
I don't have time to mess with...

22:30.597 --> 22:32.087
Oh, no!

22:32.332 --> 22:34.732
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.801 --> 22:35.468
..."Fighting for Her Smile."

22:35.468 --> 22:36.903
Fighting for Her Smile
..."Fighting for Her Smile."

22:36.903 --> 22:39.963
Fighting for Her Smile
